# === My Personal Dual-PC Local Overrides (CRUCIAL)
# This ignores your 0.18859 mouse multiplier and Medium graphics presets
Config/DefaultEngineLocal.ini
Config/DefaultEditorPerProjectUserSettings.ini

# === Core Unreal Engine Temporary Folders
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
